# Consumed by the `devenv <cmd>` shell function, which runs
# `op run --env-file=~/.config/devbox/secrets.env -- <cmd>`.
#
# Every value must be an `op://<vault>/<item>/<field>` reference; `op run` fails
# the whole command on an unresolvable one, so add lines only for items that
# exist. Requires an active session: eval "$(op signin)".

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=op://Private/anthropic/credential
# OPENAI_API_KEY=op://Private/openai/credential
# GEMINI_API_KEY=op://Private/gemini/credential
